    res/values-night/themes_accent.xml  ──  DARK variants
    ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
    Mirror of res/values/themes_accent.xml for night / dark mode.
    Android picks this file automatically — IDENTICAL style names.

    Dark design rules applied:
      • Backgrounds: #0F172A (blue-dark) or #111827 — never #000000
      • Primary: tone ~80 (pastel, desaturated — never neon)
      • Containers: tone ~30 (dark tonal pockets)
      • Surfaces: layered dark neutrals for tonal elevation
    ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
-->
